  "notes": "{根拠|こんきょ} refers to evidence or reasoning that supports a claim or action.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {根拠|こんきょ}がある: to have grounds/basis\n- {根拠|こんきょ}がない: to have no basis, baseless\n- {根拠|こんきょ}を{示|しめ}す: to show evidence\n- {根拠|こんきょ}に{基|もと}づく: to be based on evidence\n- {科学的|かがくてき}{根拠|こんきょ}: scientific evidence\n- {法的|ほうてき}{根拠|こんきょ}: legal basis\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {理由|りゆう}: reason (more general)\n- {証拠|しょうこ}: evidence, proof (concrete)",
